Retrieval Augmentation Generation
technique used in AI to improve the answers of an LLM

- stuffing prompt with only relevant info that is requested
Stage 1: Document Ingestion
    - takes data, reads it, and chunks it up
    - embeds the chunked data into vector database
        - stores vectors and math
Stage 2: RAG
    - takes prompt and finds all the data in the vector database that will help answer the prompt
    - turns prompt into embedding and then searches vector database
        - the closer the content, the closer the vectors

AI responds with its own info + info from the vector database